{"sections":{"image_banner":{"type":"image-banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_1200_x_400_px.svg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"adapt","image_behavior":"none","desktop_content_position":"middle-center","desktop_content_alignment":"center","show_text_box":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"mobile_content_alignment":"center","show_text_below":false}},"rich_text_QCKePb":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"text_EhDzCc":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>At Mr Chocolate’s Travel, we believe every traveller has a story worth telling — and that no two stories are ever the same. That’s why we’ve created <strong>Mr Chocolate’s Storybook Itineraries<\/strong>: a collection of journeys inspired by the world’s most beloved tales, iconic people, and favourite shows and movies, designed to spark ideas for your own unique adventure.<\/p><p>Each Storybook Itinerary brings inspiration to life, weaving together memorable destinations, magical experiences, and those little moments that become the heart of your travel story. From fairy-tale castles and cinematic landscapes to legendary figures and timeless adventures, each theme invites you to step into a world of imagination and possibility.<\/p><p>Explore the themes below and see where your story could begin.<br\/><strong>We can’t wait to help you create your perfect Storybook Itinerary.<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Where will your story take you?<\/strong><\/p>"}},"button_HkhnK4":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Enquire Here","button_link":"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha","button_style_secondary":true,"button_label_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_secondary_2":false}}},"block_order":["text_EhDzCc","button_HkhnK4"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"scheme-2","full_width":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"multirow_KQdnJc":{"type":"multirow","blocks":{"row_NDH8Y